</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>A</span><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Здесь
темно, словно
в шахте, но
ушли все, кто мог
что-то рыть;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">     </span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>D</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">                                     
</span></span><span class="SpellE"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>Hm</span></span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>И когда
ты выходишь,
ты видишь,
что это не смыть.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">        </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">                    
</span></span><span class="SpellE"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>G</span></span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>/</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
