color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>#<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">           
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>Em</span><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">   </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>F</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>#</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>m</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>И ты
хотел бы быть
вежливым,
только
оборвана нить;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">       </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>G</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'> </span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">      </span></span><span class="SpellE"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>G</span></span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>/</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>f</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>#<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">        </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
