"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">      </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>D</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">        </span><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Да и что
тебе делать
здесь, если
здесь нечего
пить.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Проигрыш</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>: D G D <span class="GramE">A</span> - 2p.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>И ты
гложешь
лекарства,
как будто
твёрдый коньяк;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>И врачи,
как один,
утверждают,
что это - <span class="GramE">голяк</span>.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>И
директор
твоей
конторы,
наверно,
маньяк:<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Он
зовёт на
ковёр, а
потом
говорит тебе:
"Ляг".<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Проигрыш</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
